# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Large-scale hardware example: SQD on N$_2$ {#large-scale-hardware-example-sqd-on-n-2}"
msgstr "Contoh hardware skala besar: SQD pada N$_2$ {#large-scale-hardware-example-sqd-on-n-2}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we put all components together into a complete quantum chemistry workflow at a larger scale, executed on real IBM Quantum hardware through QRMI.\n"
msgstr "Di sini kita menyatukan semua komponen menjadi alur kerja kimia quantum yang lengkap pada skala yang lebih besar, dijalankan pada hardware IBM Quantum nyata melalui QRMI.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**SQD** combines the following:\n"
"1. Quantum sampling of a Local Unitary Cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) ansatz constructed using `ffsim` and initialized from CCSD amplitudes\n"
"2. Hardware-aware transpilation matching the heavy-hex lattice topology via `generate_lucj_pass_manager`\n"
"3. Sampling execution on IBM Quantum hardware managed through `QRMIService` and QRMI `SamplerV2`\n"
"4. Classical post-processing: self-consistent configuration recovery and iterative subspace diagonalization using `qiskit-addon-sqd`\n"
msgstr ""
"**SQD** menggabungkan hal-hal berikut:\n"
"1. Sampling quantum dari ansatz Local Unitary Cluster Jastrow (LUCJ) yang dibangun menggunakan `ffsim` dan diinisialisasi dari amplitudo CCSD\n"
"2. Transpilasi yang sadar hardware yang cocok dengan topologi lattice heavy-hex melalui `generate_lucj_pass_manager`\n"
"3. Eksekusi sampling pada hardware IBM Quantum yang dikelola melalui `QRMIService` dan `SamplerV2` QRMI\n"
"4. Pasca-pemrosesan klasik: pemulihan konfigurasi self-consistent dan diagonalisasi subspace iteratif menggunakan `qiskit-addon-sqd`\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We apply SQD to N$_2$ at a bond distance of 1.0 $\\AA$ with an active space derived from the `cc-pVDZ` basis set (26 spatial orbitals, corresponding to 52 spin-orbitals/qubits).\n"
msgstr "Kita menerapkan SQD pada N$_2$ pada jarak ikatan 1,0 $\\AA$ dengan active space yang diturunkan dari basis set `cc-pVDZ` (26 orbital spasial, setara dengan 52 spin-orbital/qubit).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Reference energy for N$_2$ /cc-pVDZ active space (bond distance 1.0 $\\AA$):**\n"
"- Reference energy (separate SCI calculation): **−109.22802922 Ha**\n"
msgstr ""
"**Energi referensi untuk active space N$_2$ /cc-pVDZ (jarak ikatan 1,0 $\\AA$):**\n"
"- Energi referensi (perhitungan SCI terpisah): **−109,22802922 Ha**\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Accuracy of the saved run\">\n"
msgstr "<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Akurasi dari jalankan yang tersimpan\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The SQD run below demonstrates successful end-to-end QRMI execution on IBM Quantum hardware. With a single LUCJ repetition and 100,000 shots the result finishes approximately 23.7 kcal/mol above the reference energy and does not achieve chemical accuracy (≤ 1 kcal/mol). Changing `n_reps`, the shot count, or the number of SQD iterations might improve accuracy, but requires further testing.\n"
msgstr "Jalankan SQD di bawah ini mendemonstrasikan eksekusi QRMI end-to-end yang berhasil pada hardware IBM Quantum. Dengan satu pengulangan LUCJ dan 100.000 shot, hasilnya berada sekitar 23,7 kcal/mol di atas energi referensi dan tidak mencapai akurasi kimia (≤ 1 kcal/mol). Mengubah `n_reps`, jumlah shot, atau jumlah iterasi SQD mungkin dapat meningkatkan akurasi, tetapi membutuhkan pengujian lebih lanjut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the saved run, the `ffsim` pass manager removed the opposite-spin interactions `(24, 24)` and `(20, 20)` because the backend could not accommodate them. The reported results use this adjusted circuit.\n"
msgstr "Dalam jalankan yang tersimpan, pass manager `ffsim` menghapus interaksi spin-berlawanan `(24, 24)` dan `(20, 20)` karena backend tidak dapat mengakomodasinya. Hasil yang dilaporkan menggunakan circuit yang telah disesuaikan ini.\n"

